       <item>
        <widget class="QLabel" name="label_4">
         <property name="minimumSize">
          <size>
           <width>0</width>
           <height>30</height>
          </size>
         </property>
         <property name="toolTip">
          <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,PingFang SC,Roboto,Ubuntu,Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,Hiragino Sans GB,Microsoft YaHei UI,Microsoft YaHei,Source Han Sans CN,sans-serif'; font-size:12pt; font-weight:400; color:rgba(0,0,0,0.898039); background-color:#ffffff;&quot;&gt;是否在训练SVM前对特征进行缩放（如标准化或归一化）。布尔值（&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,PingFang SC,Microsoft YaHei'; font-size:12pt; font-weight:400; color:rgba(0,0,0,0.898039);&quot;&gt;True&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,PingFang SC,Roboto,Ubuntu,Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,Hiragino Sans GB,Microsoft YaHei UI,Microsoft YaHei,Source Han Sans CN,sans-serif'; font-size:12pt; font-weight:400; color:rgba(0,0,0,0.898039); background-color:#ffffff;&quot;&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,PingFang SC,Microsoft YaHei'; font-size:12pt; font-weight:400; color:rgba(0,0,0,0.898039);&quot;&gt;False&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,PingFang SC,Roboto,Ubuntu,Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,Hiragino Sans GB,Microsoft YaHei UI,Microsoft YaHei,Source Han Sans CN,sans-serif'; font-size:12pt; font-weight:400; color:rgba(0,0,0,0.898039); background-color:#ffffff;&quot;&gt;），但通常作为独立的预处理步骤。对于SVM，​&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,PingFang SC,Microsoft YaHei'; font-size:12pt; color:rgba(0,0,0,0.898039);&quot;&gt;强烈建议进行特征缩放&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,PingFang SC,Roboto,Ubuntu,Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,Hiragino Sans GB,Microsoft YaHei UI,Microsoft YaHei,Source Han Sans CN,sans-serif'; font-size:12pt; font-weight:400; color:rgba(0,0,0,0.898039); background-color:#ffffff;&quot;&gt;​&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,PingFang SC,Roboto,Ubuntu,Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,Hiragino Sans GB,Microsoft YaHei UI,Microsoft YaHei,Source Han Sans CN,sans-serif'; font-size:12pt; font-weight:400; color:rgba(0,0,0,0.898039); background-color:#ffffff;&quot;&gt;。这能确保所有特征在相同量纲上，避免某些特征因数值范围大而主导模型，从而提升模型性能与训练稳定性。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
         </property>
